  m_text: "The Monster King Transformation comes with an inherent attack, Fangs,
    which inflicts bleeding on enemies that it hits. You also have an energy bar,
    which, when full, allows you to transform. \n\nWhile transformed you increase
    your movement speed, the attack speed of your Fangs, and causes all your weapons
    to inflict bleeding on enemies. \n\nYour transformation also has 3 upgrades and
    you're able to choose one every 10 levels."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 719f80d5e5f25694ca887ff4b91e2905, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1003606389510534732, guid: 719f80d5e5f25694ca887ff4b91e2905, type: 2}
